<title>USA: Pacific Sunwear files for 700,000 shares.</title>
<headline>Pacific Sunwear files for 700,000 shares.</headline>
<dateline>ANAHEIM, Calif. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pacific Sunwear of California Inc said Friday it filed  with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission for the offering of 700,000 common shares.</p>
<p>The offering will be made through Robertson, Stephens &amp; Co LLC, Alex. Brown &amp; Sons Inc and Robinson-Humphrey Co, it said.</p>
<p>Pacific Sunwear, a specialty retailer of casual apparel, accessories and footwear for teens and young adults, operates 221 stores in 33 states.</p>
